After the first drive: $(0.5,18)$. The stop ends after $0.5+0.75=1.25$ hours, giving $(1.25,18)$. The second drive ends after $1.25+1.25=2.5$ hours, at $18+24=42$ km from the start. Plot $(0,0)$, $(0.5,18)$, $(1.25,18)$ and $(2.5,42)$, then join consecutive points.
