\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(128,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,88);
\foreach \t in {0,20,40,60,80,100,120} \node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\t,0) {$\t$};
\foreach \d in {20,40,60,80} \node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (0,\d) {$\d$};
\node[below] at (60,-13) {Time (minutes)};
\node[rotate=90] at (-30,40) {Distance from home (km)};
\draw[blue,line width=0.8pt] (0,0)--(20,20)--(35,20)--(110,70);
\foreach \t/\d in {0/0,20/20,35/20,110/70} \fill[blue] (\t,\d) circle (1.5pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Start at $(7{:}20\text{ am},0)$. At the station: $(7{:}40\text{ am},2)$. After the train: $(8{:}00\text{ am},14)$ because $2+12=14$ km. The wait ends at $(8{:}10\text{ am},14)$. School is reached at $(8{:}40\text{ am},20)$ because $14+6=20$ km. Plot the points and join consecutive points. The wait is horizontal.
