He waits $10$ minutes for a bus, which then travels $7.5$ km and reaches school at $8{:}35$ am.
All travel is away from home along the same route.
Draw his distance–time graph on the grid.

mastery.solution_text:
Station: $(7{:}30,\,2.5\text{ km})$
Off the train: $(7{:}50,\,2.5+15)=(7{:}50,\,17.5\text{ km})$
Bus leaves: $(8{:}00,\,17.5\text{ km})$
School: $(8{:}35,\,17.5+7.5)=(8{:}35,\,25\text{ km})$
