A car leaves home and drives away at $60$ km/h for $1$ hour, stops for $30$ minutes, then continues away from home at $80$ km/h for $1$ hour $30$ minutes.
Draw its distance–time graph on the grid.

mastery.solution_text:
$d_{1}=60\times1$
$=60\text{ km}$
$d_{2}=80\times1.5$
$=120\text{ km}$
End of stage $1$: $(1\text{ h},\,60\text{ km})$
